// View-dependent specular from the strongest cached, shadowed light. This keeps
// metals lit without a per-light or shadow-ray loop inside every mirror bounce.
// The row stores the strongest light relative to nothing in particular: a direction (w==0,
// directional light) or the light's position and its distance from the row's anchor (w>0).
// The direction and inverse-square falloff are re-derived at the shaded point, so a highlight
// stays round inside a coarse row instead of turning into a lit square.
